    "body": "Maybe using a lambda would be clearer here.\n\n1. Let _protocols_ be the return value of running these steps:\n   1. If _protocolsOrOptions_ is a dictionary, then return _protocolsOrOptions_[\"protocols\"].\n   2. If _protocolsOrOptions_ is a string, then return « _protocolsOrOptions_ ».\n   3. Return _protocolsOrOptions_.",
